  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#selector-target claims to be a definition for the `:target` pseudoclass, which conflicts with the one in Selectors when doing autolinking. Could you mark it `noexport`?\n\nIf any of the other selectors on that page are `<dfn>`d, please unexport them too. (I didn't check.)\n",
